## Interface: 16001
## Title: ClickLegend
## Notes: Shows your click-cast bindings as an on-screen icon legend (ally and enemy spells for every bound key or button) and in unit tooltips. Reads EllesmereUI HoverCast, Clique, VuhDo, HealBot and the game's own Click Casting.
